    narr:narration """This hub gathers the architecture decision around the analytics pipeline database, all dated 20260717 and attributed to QuintonFairweather. The adoption commitment is stated directly in [the adoption declaration](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) and restated in compressed form in [the database summary entry](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4): Zypherion is the chosen technology. The performance rationale appears in [the columnar-query benchmark claim](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) and its parallel restatement in [the performance summary entry](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5). The timeline is carried by [the next-quarter migration commitment](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3), with the specific quarter pinned in [the Q3 2026 timeline entry](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6). A broader narrative frame — columnar optimization as the driver — is held in [the shift-to-columnar narrative node](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_AnalyticsDatabaseAdoption). The three source expressions and their three parallel restatements form the structural spine; no dissent or alternative vendor appears in this graph.""" ;
